                          71 --29: /* PRQA S 0311,0316 ++ # D004 The cast needed to pass to the driver API.
                          72 --30:                          There is no problem because it recognizes that the cast value is passed on the driver side. */
                          73 --31: /* PRQA S 0751 ++ # D006 Cast required to match the type of the calling function */
                          74 --32: /* PRQA S 1503 ++ # D010 No problem if it is unused because it is an API called from outside the library  */
