                        6440 --2182:  * \par Precondition
                        6441 --2183:  *  - None
                        6442 --2184:  * \par Detailed description
                        6443 --2185:  *      - Make sure the argument is not NULL.
                        6444 --2186:  *      - Make sure the bite length is at least twice the curve length.
                        6445 --2187:  * \par Remarks
                        6446 --2188:  *  - The signature data and the coordinate point data have the same length range,
                        6447 --2189:  *    so they are grouped into the same function.
                        6448 --2190:  *
                        6449 --2191:  * Pseudo-code for the function can be found below.
