                        8294 --2983:  *      - Make sure the argument is not NULL.
                        8295 --2984:  *      - Call #r_pkcl_ec_chk_curve to check the curve information of p_ctx.
                        8296 --2985:  *      - If p_ctx->p_kdf_info is not NULL, make sure p_kdf_api is not NULL.
                        8297 --2986:  *      - If p_ctx->p_kdf_info is NULL, make sure the length of p_shared is greater than or equal to the curve length.
                        8298 --2987:  *      - If p_ctx->p_kdf_info is not NULL, make sure the length of p_shared is greater than or equal to out_kdf_len.
                        8299 --2988:  * \par Remarks
                        8300 --2989:  *  - None
